## Code Quality Standards

### Readability
- Clear variable names
- Logical code organization
- Consistent formatting
- Minimal nesting

### Maintainability
- Single responsibility principle
- Dependency injection where appropriate
- Modular architecture
- Easy to test

### Performance
- Efficient algorithms
- Minimal allocations
- Cached calculations
- Optimized rendering

Remember: This is an MVP focused on core functionality. Prioritize working features over perfect architecture. Code should be clean, functional, and ready for production deployment.
